   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective, modernized, and efficient State Tax Service</narrative>
   </description>
   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 2</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of new registrations to increase by 5% per year during 2008-2013 (Baseline: 1,884 registrations in 2006) 
Progress/Status: Between 2007 and 2013, the number of new registrations in STS electronic database increased by 60.4% per year. 
Data Source: Surveys conducted by International Business Council (Bishkek)

STS quarterly report 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="1884" year="2006"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2013-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2013-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="2404"></target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 3</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Average time required to prepare tax returns reduced from 204 hours in 2006 to 170-195 hours by 2013 
Progress/Status: In 2012, average time spent in preparing, filing and paying taxes was 210 hours (Source: Doing Business Report 2014) 
Data Source: WB Doing Business Report 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="204" year="2006"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2013-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2013-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="170"></target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 4</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Average number of days firms spent in meetings with tax officials cut from 3.2 in 2005 to 2.8 by 2013 
Progress/Status: A survey conducted in the summer of 2013 revealed that taxpayers spent an average of 4.4 days in meetings with tax inspectors (in 2012) 
Data Source: Survey to be conducted by the Project Management Office before project completion 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="3" year="2005"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2013-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2013-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="2"></target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="2">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Large taxpayer unit tax collections to increase by at least 17% per year during 2007-2013 (Baseline: 7% in 2006) 
Progress/Status: The LTU tax collections have increased by 22.1% per year between 2007 and 2013. 
Data Source: State Tax Service (LTU) revenue statistics (annual) 
Actual value:</narrative>
