    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Communication network for tax offices developed 
Indicator: 2,000 clients in Bishkek City and all other tax offices use electronic filing by September 2012 (Baseline: 0 in 2006) 
Progress/Status: More than 4,000 taxpayers are filing their tax returns electronically. 
Data Source: TA and Project Consultants Reports

STS quarterly report 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2006"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2012-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2012-12-31"></period-end>
